sequenceDiagram
    participant Maintainer
    participant SKILLMD as skills/odyssey/SKILL.md
    participant FS as Filesystem
    participant Extract as scripts/extract_story.py

    Maintainer->>SKILLMD: /prodyssey:generate --prs 3
    SKILLMD->>SKILLMD: Resolve TARGET_TOPLEVEL, HUB_TOPLEVEL
    SKILLMD->>SKILLMD: Compute BUNDLE_DIR = TARGET_TOPLEVEL/.prodyssey/self

    SKILLMD->>FS: Does BUNDLE_DIR exist?

    alt BUNDLE_DIR missing and legacy .odyssey exists
        FS-->>SKILLMD: .odyssey/ found, .prodyssey/self/ missing
        SKILLMD-->>Maintainer: STOP - bundle predates .prodyssey/self layout
        SKILLMD-->>Maintainer: "git -C target mv .odyssey .prodyssey/self"
        note over SKILLMD: Detect but never auto-migrate -\nskill never edits target repo source,\nand silent regen would burn Gemini cost\nover hand-authored narrative
    else BUNDLE_DIR exists, or neither path exists
        FS-->>SKILLMD: Proceed with resolved BUNDLE_DIR
        SKILLMD->>Extract: uv run extract_story.py --repo target --bundle-dir BUNDLE_DIR
        Extract->>FS: Read/write BUNDLE_DIR/data/story.json
        FS-->>Extract: story.json (existing authored fields preserved)
        Extract-->>SKILLMD: Bundle updated at .prodyssey/self
        SKILLMD-->>Maintainer: Continues sweep (art, audio, diagrams)
    end
